. ** A4. Robustness of the headline model **
. eststo clear

. foreach w in 2014 2018 2022 {
  2.     * (a) complaints index with sleep difficulties added
.     if `w' != 2018 eststo Ra_s`w': quietly reg complaints4 share_bro $SIB if s_sib & wave == `w', vce(cluster classid)
  3.     eststo Ra_c`w': quietly reg complaints4 share_girls_cls $CLS if s_cls & wave == `w', vce(cluster classid)
  4.     * (b) standard errors clustered by school instead of class
.     if `w' != 2018 eststo Rb_s`w': quietly reg complaints3 share_bro $SIB if s_sib & wave == `w', vce(cluster school)
  5.     eststo Rb_c`w': quietly reg complaints3 share_girls_cls $CLS if s_cls & wave == `w', vce(cluster school)
  6.     * (c) class share based on at least 8 respondents (less noisy)
.     eststo Rc_c`w': quietly reg complaints3 share_girls_cls $CLS if s_cls & n_class >= 8 & wave == `w', vce(cluster classid)
  7.     * (e) sibling gender defined as "at least one brother" instead of the share
.     if `w' != 2018 eststo Re_s`w': quietly reg complaints3 any_bro $SIB if s_sib & wave == `w', vce(cluster classid)
  8. }

. * (d) 2014 only: add father's and mother's occupation
. eststo Rd_s2014: quietly reg complaints3 share_bro $SIB i.father_occ i.mother_occ if s_sib & wave == 2014, vce(cluster classi
> d)

. eststo Rd_c2014: quietly reg complaints3 share_girls_cls $CLS i.father_occ i.mother_occ if s_cls & wave == 2014, vce(cluster 
> classid)

. esttab Ra_* Rb_* Rc_* Rd_* Re_* using "$out/tables/A4_robustness.tex", replace `tex' keep(share_bro share_girls_cls any_bro) 
> ///
