. ** A7. Possible channels (mechanisms) **
. * For all five outcomes, HIGHER = WORSE (harder to talk to a parent, more bullied,
. * less classmate support, likes school less), so a negative coefficient is "better".
. foreach w in 2014 2018 2022 {
  2.     eststo clear
  3.     foreach m in z_talkmother z_talkfather z_beenbullied z_studsupport z_likeschool {
  4.         if `w' != 2018 eststo MS_`m': quietly reg `m' share_bro $SIB if s_sib & wave == `w', vce(cluster classid)
  5.         eststo MC_`m': quietly reg `m' share_girls_cls $CLS if s_cls & wave == `w', vce(cluster classid)
  6.     }
  7.     if `w' != 2018 {
  8.         esttab MS_* using "$out/tables/A7_mechanisms_siblings_`w'.tex", replace `tex' keep(share_bro) ///
>             title("Channels: sibling gender, `w'")
  9.     }
 10.     esttab MC_* using "$out/tables/A7_mechanisms_class_`w'.tex", replace `tex' keep(share_girls_cls) ///
>         title("Channels: class composition, `w'")
 11. }
